WEBVTT

00:09:28.689 --> 00:09:30.899
but I'd never taught kids before.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.195
But the night before school
closures in San Francisco,

00:09:35.237 --> 00:09:36.488
I went on Instagram

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:42.077
and announced that the next day
we'd try something called DrawTogether.

00:09:44.163 --> 00:09:45.539
10 am.

00:09:45.581 --> 00:09:50.169
I sat behind my drawing table
in my home studio

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.880
and my wonderful wife
pointed an iPhone at me

00:09:52.921 --> 00:09:54.465
and pressed "Go live."

00:09:54.465 --> 00:09:57.343
And what I thought would be 100 kids,

00:09:57.343 --> 00:10:00.512
ended up being 12,000.